00:04:43,636 --> 00:04:49,636
Be careful what you search for.

2
00:09:27,272 --> 00:09:33,272
Life is a horror, science fiction, mystery film directed by Daniel Espinosa.

3
00:14:10,909 --> 00:14:16,909
The six-member crew of the International Space Station is tasked with studying a sample from Mars that may be
the first proof of extra-terrestrial life, which proves more intelligent than ever expected.

4
00:18:54,545 --> 00:19:00,545
Dr. David Jordan, played by Jake Gyllenhaal.

5
00:23:38,181 --> 00:23:44,181
Rory Adams, played by Ryan Reynolds.

6
00:28:21,818 --> 00:28:27,818
Miranda North, played by Rebecca Ferguson.

7
00:33:05,454 --> 00:33:11,454
Sho Murakami, played by Hiroyuki Sanada.

8
00:37:49,090 --> 00:37:55,090
